# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): the Live page's knobs' pages on SELECT over a D chord: PLAY, CHORDS
# (Snap turned to a wash), ARP, LEAD and MIX (to come), HOME back to PLAY, CHORDS in Q, and the progression's PLAY and
# CHORDS (its Way). Not a test of its own.
notips
tap PLAY
wait 1500
tapkey 9
wait 1500
shot p1-play.png
turn SELECT 1
wait 400
shot p2-chords.png
turn K1 -6
wait 300
shot p2-chords-snap.png
wait 1500
turn SELECT 1
wait 400
shot p3-arp.png
turn SELECT 1
wait 400
shot p4-lead.png
turn SELECT 1
turn SELECT 3
wait 400
shot p5-mix.png
tap HOME
wait 400
shot back-home.png
tap SEL
turn SELECT 1
wait 400
shot q-chords.png
tap HOME
tap HOME
wait 2000
shot prog-play.png
turn SELECT 1
wait 400
shot prog-chords.png
